1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:02,210
(Howard:)C-6 was a hit, C-8 was a hit.

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:04,410
(Howard:)Part of your starship
has to be on C-7.

3
00:00:04,410 --> 00:00:07,050
(Raj:)Not if it has a hole
in the middle.

4
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:11,850
(Howard:)What kind of spaceship
has a hole in the middle?

5
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:15,420
(Raj:)A Romulan Battle Bagel?

6
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:18,760
(Bernadette:)Knock-knock.

7
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,360
(Howard:)Oh, great, you made it.

8
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:21,560
(Penny's Dad:)Come on in.

9
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:23,860
(Howard:)I invited her.

10
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:26,000
(Bernadette:)So where's
the telescope?

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,900
(Howard:)It's in Hawaii, but Raj
controls it from here.

12
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:31,570
(Howard:)He's hoping to see Epsilon
Eridani dim, which would be

13
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:34,570
(Howard:)evidence of a planet
orbiting it.

14
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:36,110
(Bernadette:)So we just sit and stare
at the screen,

15
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:37,310
(Bernadette:)waiting for
something to happen?

16
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:41,410
I did it with you when
we rented The Notebook.

17
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:47,790
(Howard:)Yes, Gena Rowlands
is a treasure.

18
00:00:47,790 --> 00:00:50,640
(Howard:)You'd better open up
that bottle of wine

19
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:54,280
(Howard:)or I'm gonna end up
with swimmer's ear.

20
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:55,430
(Raj:)Excuse me.

21
00:00:55,430 --> 00:00:57,160
(Raj:)I can't be drinking,
I'm about to make

22
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:58,930
(Raj:)an important scientific
discovery here.

23
00:00:58,930 --> 00:01:02,100
(Howard:)What? Galileo did his best work
while drinking wine.

